---
import ContentLayout from '../../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
import SetupScene from '../../components/SetupScene.astro';
---
<ContentLayout title="Midnight Shift gaming setup | StackGeist" description="A dark gaming and work setup focused on usable desk space, low clutter, and controlled lighting." active="setups">
  <p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/setups/gaming">Gaming setups</a> / Midnight Shift</p>
  <p class="page-kicker">Gaming + work</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">Midnight Shift</h1>
  <p class="page-lead">A dark setup for people who want atmosphere without turning the room into an RGB carnival.</p>

  <section class="content-section split">
    <SetupScene />
    <div class="copy-panel">
      <p class="page-kicker">The idea</p>
      <h2>Protect the desk first.</h2>
      <p>The setup keeps the center work area open, pushes lighting off the desk surface, and treats cable routing as part of the build instead of an afterthought.</p>
      <div class="facts">
        <div class="fact"><span>Use</span><strong>Gaming · work · console</strong></div>
        <div class="fact"><span>Space</span><strong>Small-room friendly</strong></div>
        <div class="fact"><span>Look</span><strong>Dark with selective violet light</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <p class="page-kicker">Gear used</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Every recommendation should solve a setup problem.</h2>
    <div class="gear-list">
      <a class="gear-row" href="/gear/desk-lighting"><div><strong>Desk / bias lighting</strong><span>Two verified routes: functional task light or lower-cost monitor backlight.</span></div><em>See options →</em></a>
      <div class="gear-row"><div><strong>Monitor support</strong><span>Product selection still pending verification.</span></div><em>Researching</em></div>
      <div class="gear-row"><div><strong>Cable management</strong><span>Product selection still pending verification.</span></div><em>Researching</em></div>
      <div class="gear-row"><div><strong>Desk surface / mat</strong><span>Product selection still pending verification.</span></div><em>Researching</em></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section"><div class="note">Affiliate products are only added after the exact model, relevant specifications, and purchase fit are checked. We do not imply that placeholder gear has been tested or personally used.</div></section>
</ContentLayout>
